      542.6,
      245.12
    ],
    "text": "1. Only a number of candidates not more than five times the number of vacancies from among the candidates securing the minimum aggregate of marks not less than 300 after having sat for all seven (07) question papers of the written examination will be invited for the Interview for evaluating eligibility.",
